		{
			"id":"57127df95c0ca31a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"取等号条件",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":10363,
			"y":17241,
			"width":280,
			"height":79
		},
		{"id":"8db14a73a523fc2c","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260604195154.png","x":-2350,"y":1606,"width":599,"height":275},
		{"id":"2c5dc2b38934abce","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260810223633.png","x":-2287,"y":2280,"width":676,"height":60},
		{"id":"72804d64db160ef7","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260505155529.png","x":-669,"y":1998,"width":599,"height":54},
		{"id":"246bad1523ce0866","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260505155643.png","x":-669,"y":2052,"width":623,"height":119},
		{
			"id":"c721cbc10d8275ce",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. 构造新的行列式，利用展开定理（替换某一行/列）\n2. 转化成伴随矩阵\n\t1. 通过伴随矩阵的定义\n\t2. 伴随矩阵的性质\n",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-2259,
			"y":2460,
			"width":620,
			"height":200
		},
		{"id":"a78a16f3545abb99","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/a1b1294a496e436028d78ee9d77e8ecd.jpeg","x":-9,"y":1905,"width":700,"height":268},
		{"id":"15eef9804e80cd4b","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/ChatGPT Image 2026年8月6日 20_28_25.png","x":-1751,"y":1606,"width":283,"height":400},
		{"id":"4234f49e856ecc12","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260505154629.png","x":-1013,"y":1185,"width":525,"height":206},
		{"id":"4306c8b30fedb624","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260505155709.png","x":-671,"y":1880,"width":625,"height":118},
		{"id":"f884fbc7787652e0","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260531171250.png","x":-1800,"y":1309,"width":400,"height":118},
		{
			"id":"a11000fe4aff40ae",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"碰到伴随矩阵的四个思考角度",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-2210,
			"y":1526,
			"width":320,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"81c02e1965eaafb1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"二阶矩阵求伴随、求逆",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-2340,
			"y":1279,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"c0c6cd76d244f821","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260604170019.png","x":10480,"y":9405,"width":824,"height":249},
		{
			"id":"fbbfb682291c4e05",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"什么时候只能行变换，什么时候行列变换可以同时",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":10503,
			"y":9345,
			"width":780,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"5401217f87a8cbca",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"很好的一题，考察了公式",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":10320,
			"y":5103,
			"width":300,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"9acea999602ee368",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"题目两个小问递进，第一问是为了证明第二问",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":10360,
			"y":3810,
			"width":480,
			"height":172
		},
		{
			"id":"d00461c89b80fd34",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"综合性很好的一题",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":10420,
			"y":5591,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"1d0cec375f7796be",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"③④ 从方程组的角度理解",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":10040,
			"y":14774,
			"width":280,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"699219d01e67b3be",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"伪消去率的推广形式",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":10260,
			"y":10774,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"5b34cfead197ee2a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"遇到伴随矩阵需要思考的公式与性质",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":10700,
			"y":12960,
			"width":420,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"d191563379fae413",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"A 可以相似对角化：\n\n1. 实对称矩阵（两个 Gram 矩阵相加）\n2. 三个不同的特征值",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":10420,
			"y":12221,
			"width":440,
			"height":180
		},
		{"id":"7c460a0c2c35f67f","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260506172015.png","x":9617,"y":2555,"width":620,"height":181},
		{"id":"bbb197ad9ddd0372","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260506171546.png","x":9645,"y":2201,"width":602,"height":266},
		{
			"id":"b0efe50a02009cdf",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"矩阵相乘：\n\n1. 膨胀，必**不满秩**\n2. 缩小，秩满秩不满秩**不确定**",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":9092,
			"y":2536,
			"width":350,
			"height":219
		},
		{"id":"1863917161196201","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260506172423.png","x":9179,"y":3258,"width":655,"height":181},
		{"id":"3d65626f00682191","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260506172236.png","x":9179,"y":3015,"width":648,"height":243},
		{"id":"9807c6a62a5a2e8b","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260505160131.png","x":2975,"y":1601,"width":725,"height":487},
		{
			"id":"425250880d70af69",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"每个矩阵的行最简是唯一的",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":2252,
			"y":1845,
			"width":340,
			"height":80
		},
		{"id":"6ac678326ab53ffa","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260604162924.png","x":1098,"y":1610,"width":470,"height":139},
		{
			"id":"a1869a78ffa5c76f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"线性方程组求解的基本定理：对于任何非零矩阵 $A$，总可以经过有限次**初等行变换**把它化成行阶梯形矩阵和行最简阶梯形矩阵",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":2182,
			"y":1620,
			"width":480,
			"height":120
		},
		{"id":"85b850bb60c530db","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/result_9q3GDk.png","x":2060,"y":1213,"width":723,"height":291},
		{"id":"0a317d5796869f08","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260604162232.png","x":599,"y":1504,"width":497,"height":245},
		{"id":"1ab0902fcaec2003","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260505155125.png","x":1279,"y":1428,"width":598,"height":64},
		{"id":"af9ed8ce938b36b1","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/631fc168949a541dea37315d36b3deec.jpeg","x":1279,"y":1185,"width":596,"height":243},
		{
			"id":"0a4197f0f5352858",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"倍加初等矩阵不建议用简写，不同教材表示方式不一致",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":71,
			"y":2286,
			"width":540,
			"height":80
		},
		{"id":"53f29b14a102295c","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260505155938.png","x":2900,"y":1238,"width":875,"height":205},
		{"id":"2ae99a7dc979f107","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260505154718.png","x":599,"y":1132,"width":499,"height":372},
		{"id":"8d20d9cb346b2ca1","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260809163400.png","x":-8375,"y":3208,"width":750,"height":568},
		{"id":"080cba4c9517cfff","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260531170845.png","x":-7336,"y":4641,"width":221,"height":223},
		{"id":"562f66da6c89486c","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260807175910.png","x":-7625,"y":4040,"width":490,"height":535},
		{"id":"92b3e58e0287028d","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260531170654.png","x":-7760,"y":4641,"width":424,"height":223},
		{
			"id":"17a736af32c80794",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"反对称矩阵的性质\n\n1. 主对角线上元素都是 $0$ \n2. **奇数阶**反对称矩阵，行列式为 $0$ \n3. 反对称矩阵 $A$，二次型 $x^TAx = 0$，$\\forall x$ ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-8260,
			"y":4100,
			"width":400,
			"height":240
		},
		{"id":"95d1b84427451f33","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260809165433.png","x":-5320,"y":2179,"width":746,"height":150},
		{"id":"6f4858dc1102c01f","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/result_BxVn6W.png","x":-6920,"y":942,"width":745,"height":575},
		{"id":"6ae62c88f3bf0e35","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260809170420.png","x":-5322,"y":2329,"width":750,"height":285},
		{
			"id":"176175f56f9c961c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"逆矩阵常用三条性质",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-4722,
			"y":1385,
			"width":260,
